  "Several choices: one MultiSelect. `form.services` posts an array of the chosen `value`s (`[\"calendar\", \"mail\"]`). `variant`: `buttonSelectionGroup` shows a toggle button per option, `combobox` (the default) a dropdown with checkmarks.",
